WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:03.800
Ah, that was delicious.

00:02.980 --> 00:12.860
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:12.920 --> 00:13.580
Squishy...

00:15.020 --> 00:15.630
Are you feeling good?

00:19.340 --> 00:27.220
When you and I have nuzzled...

00:28.980 --> 00:32.960
We're already friends...

00:33.480 --> 00:37.410
We'll always be together...

00:38.140 --> 00:40.510
I'll...

00:41.810 --> 00:44.060
Eureka, that's a lovely song.

00:44.620 --> 00:45.890
It's the Squishy Song!

00:47.080 --> 00:48.430
I made it.

00:51.460 --> 00:54.920
Satoshi and his friends are heading to Eisetsu City, where the eighth Gym is located.

00:55.530 --> 00:59.010
And they are observed by...

01:07.310 --> 01:08.120
This is headquarters.

01:08.570 --> 01:09.730
Connect us to the boss, please.

01:10.430 --> 01:11.020
Please hold.

01:15.260 --> 01:16.130
Sakaki-sama!

01:17.060 --> 01:18.020
So it's you guys...

01:18.370 --> 01:18.890
What's the matter?

01:19.260 --> 01:19.550
Reporting:

01:20.080 --> 01:22.560
There is something we absolutely need to report to you.

01:23.570 --> 01:30.360
There is an organization here in Kalos that will hinder the Rocket Gang from conquering the world.

01:31.540 --> 01:32.030
Right!

01:33.140 --> 01:34.320
Have you confirmed that?

01:34.760 --> 01:35.170
Yes.

01:36.020 --> 01:39.290
They were wearing red costumes and disgusting glasses!

01:40.080 --> 01:41.220
So they really do exist.

01:42.860 --> 01:44.090
You know of them?

01:44.530 --> 01:44.890
Yes.

01:45.360 --> 01:50.590
You guys stay there and investigate their current state and their goals.

01:51.170 --> 01:51.730
Roger!

01:52.570 --> 01:54.510
We have another report.

01:54.900 --> 01:57.590
That organization is after a Pokémon of an entirely new species.

01:58.490 --> 01:59.340
A new species?

01:59.740 --> 02:01.170
We'll send you a picture.

02:02.600 --> 02:03.090
Oh...?

02:03.580 --> 02:07.180
It can fuse and change its appearance at will.

02:07.470 --> 02:09.560
We have never seen such a Pokémon before.

02:12.350 --> 02:13.050
Obtain it.

02:14.050 --> 02:16.030
Don't let those guys beat you to the punch.

02:16.570 --> 02:17.090
Roger!

02:17.950 --> 02:18.170
Good.

02:18.900 --> 02:19.850
I have great expectations.

02:22.670 --> 02:25.790
"I have great expectations," he said!

02:27.340 --> 02:29.750
It's been ages since our arrival in Kalos,

02:30.860 --> 02:32.750
and upon reflection, every day has indeed been full of hardship.

02:33.140 --> 02:34.440
However! However!

02:34.780 --> 02:36.080
Oh, however!

02:36.740 --> 02:38.760
Upon the annihilation of that glasses legion,

02:39.440 --> 02:41.970
we can return home loaded with honors!

02:42.430 --> 02:44.540
What about the brats and Pikachu?

02:44.970 --> 02:47.480
For now, let's concentrate on our imminent feat!

02:48.190 --> 02:49.410
Now that that's decided,

02:50.090 --> 02:51.740
let's go find...

02:52.140 --> 02:53.680
...the feel-bad glasses guys!

02:55.840 --> 02:57.460
All right!

02:57.460 --> 02:57.920
Go!

02:58.590 --> 03:00.900
All for Sakaki-sama!

03:05.250 --> 03:10.920
The Explosive Land's Wrath!
Operation: Capture Zygarde!!

03:19.150 --> 03:22.310
Hey Squishy, Harimaron and Yancham have come to play.

03:32.980 --> 03:42.820
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

03:32.980 --> 03:42.820
Z

03:37.250 --> 03:39.220
You shouldn't disturb the poor thing's afternoon nap.

03:50.490 --> 03:53.090
What is it? What happened?

04:01.400 --> 04:03.410
Answer! Answer!

04:07.290 --> 04:08.010
Squishy!

04:10.810 --> 04:11.400
What's the matter?

04:13.090 --> 04:14.530
Squishy, are you sad?

04:18.720 --> 04:26.370
I understand how you feel,

04:27.010 --> 04:30.480
I catch you cleanly, promise!

04:30.970 --> 04:34.410
I'll take care of you.

04:34.870 --> 04:40.650
I'll be by your side at any time.

04:43.310 --> 04:45.220
I pray for your safety.

04:55.650 --> 04:57.490
Manyula, well done.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.990
Hey, my Crimgan worked hard as well.

05:07.940 --> 05:10.410
Z2, you're coming with us.

05:14.960 --> 05:15.860
This is Momiji.

05:16.230 --> 05:18.710
Doctor, the beam is tremendously effective!

05:19.720 --> 05:22.770
Z2 is now unable to hide itself.

05:23.540 --> 05:26.660
Obviously! It was developed by <i>me</i>, after all.

05:27.130 --> 05:30.730
The Mega Evolution energy has proved useful again.

05:34.640 --> 05:36.350
All right, let's go.

05:39.440 --> 05:40.110
Slash!

05:47.280 --> 05:48.240
Manyula, go!

06:15.650 --> 06:16.940
Is this what Bara was talking about...?

06:17.380 --> 06:18.890
Oh, this is...

06:28.880 --> 06:29.320
Now!

06:37.930 --> 06:38.630
Dragon Pulse!

06:45.680 --> 06:46.430
Metal Claw!

06:53.560 --> 06:54.610
Fire! Fire!

07:04.190 --> 07:04.590
What?!

07:12.240 --> 07:13.800
Argh, what are you doing?!

07:14.260 --> 07:17.190
Now that the beam is in effect makes this your best chance to capture it!

07:18.660 --> 07:19.460
Understood.

07:27.890 --> 07:29.140
Any luck?

07:29.620 --> 07:32.290
The feel-bad glasses guys are nowhere to be seen, huh?

07:33.010 --> 07:35.810
Yet they always show up when we <i>don't</i> want them to...

07:38.580 --> 07:39.530
Squishy?

07:40.330 --> 07:43.330
No, its color is different. So this <i>isn't</i> Squishy...?

07:45.190 --> 07:45.990
Which means...

07:46.350 --> 07:48.200
...there's one more...

07:48.200 --> 07:50.120
...that's like Squishy!

07:50.120 --> 07:51.470
No way!

07:51.470 --> 07:54.680
Could we be the luckiest people ever?

07:56.690 --> 07:57.880
Well then...

07:57.880 --> 07:58.970
...let's get it...

07:58.970 --> 08:00.120
...right away.

08:00.870 --> 08:01.860
All for...

08:02.180 --> 08:03.560
...Sakaki-sama!

08:06.660 --> 08:07.220
Whoa!

08:14.250 --> 08:16.210
Hey, what are you doing?!

08:16.390 --> 08:17.910
Huh? The feel-bad glasses guys.

08:17.910 --> 08:19.350
<i>They</i> came to us!

08:19.800 --> 08:21.360
Who are you guys?

08:21.750 --> 08:24.070
If you ask "Who are you guys?",

08:24.810 --> 08:26.690
It is the world's mercy that makes us answer!

08:27.060 --> 08:29.140
To prevent the world's destruction!

08:29.460 --> 08:31.510
To protect the world's peace!

08:31.810 --> 08:34.290
Carrying out the evil of love and truth,

08:34.600 --> 08:36.620
we're lovely, charmy villains!

08:37.150 --> 08:38.160
Musashi!

08:38.800 --> 08:39.850
Kojiro!

08:40.880 --> 08:43.470
For the Rocket Gang duo dashing across the galaxy,

08:44.490 --> 08:47.370
a white hole, a white tomorrow awaits ahead!

08:47.800 --> 08:48.840
Just kidding!

08:49.800 --> 08:52.090
Thanks for introducing yourselves.

08:53.610 --> 08:55.540
So these are the guys that Bara and Correa mentioned.

08:55.880 --> 08:58.020
Geez, can you stop getting in the way?

08:58.500 --> 08:59.020
Capture it!

09:02.680 --> 09:04.550
It's <i>you</i> guys who should stop getting in the way!

09:04.920 --> 09:06.450
Of our highway to success!

09:06.960 --> 09:07.950
Are you really this stupid?

09:08.390 --> 09:10.530
Maaiika, destroy that beam!

09:10.810 --> 09:11.550
Psybeam!

09:15.000 --> 09:16.430
You shall go, Crimgan!

09:18.610 --> 09:19.700
Metal Claw!

09:21.630 --> 09:23.900
Go, Pumpjin! Seed Bomb!

09:35.150 --> 09:36.880
Geez, what's with those people?

09:37.710 --> 09:38.170
Find them.

09:38.410 --> 09:38.790
Roger!

09:40.830 --> 09:45.960
I'm terribly sorry. Due to some irregularities, we were unable to capture Z2.

09:46.440 --> 09:47.850
Ugh, you're pathetic!

09:48.730 --> 09:51.170
Is there anyone in the vicinity that could head there to provide backup?

09:51.990 --> 09:52.610
Please hold on.

09:54.230 --> 09:55.700
There is someone, but...

09:57.060 --> 09:59.290
...this person is your...

10:01.590 --> 10:02.550
Pokémon Quiz.

10:03.120 --> 10:03.830
The answer is...?

10:18.420 --> 10:20.350
Ugh, I can't run any more.

10:20.350 --> 10:22.440
My sides are hurting so badly...

10:22.440 --> 10:24.280
I just ran enough for one life.

10:26.550 --> 10:28.570
You guys have it good, being able to float like that.

10:29.010 --> 10:29.980
I'm jealous.

10:33.280 --> 10:34.660
Does this guy's sides hurt too?

10:35.200 --> 10:36.100
Uh, really?

10:36.770 --> 10:40.990
Come to think of it, the Squishy that's with the brats likes sunlight, right?

10:41.410 --> 10:43.670
I believe that's what made it recover its energy.

10:44.370 --> 10:45.880
Hm... Which means...

10:47.850 --> 10:49.840
Oh, how about up there?

10:50.250 --> 10:50.500
I have to go, huh...?

10:51.630 --> 10:52.050
Hup!

10:55.470 --> 10:56.420
How's this?

11:06.520 --> 11:08.530
There, there. Now you'll be fine.

11:08.930 --> 11:10.450
That's right! Now's our chance!

11:11.060 --> 11:13.110
Let's report that we got this one!

11:13.290 --> 11:15.140
Sakaki-sama will praise us!

11:17.300 --> 11:18.500
An Ice Beam?

11:18.790 --> 11:20.440
Argh! It won't come off, it won't come off!

11:22.070 --> 11:23.110
We found you.

11:26.200 --> 11:27.680
We won't let you get away this time.

11:34.200 --> 11:35.700
You follow us anywhere, huh?

11:36.530 --> 11:40.530
We can play with you as much as you want <i>after</i> we've sent this one to headquarters!

11:41.070 --> 11:43.180
Oh, but that's our line.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.480
Manyula, Metal Claw!

11:47.920 --> 11:49.790
Let's run for now!

12:00.310 --> 12:01.810
Hand that thing over, will you?

12:02.360 --> 12:04.290
Playing tag like this is so unproductive.

12:04.640 --> 12:05.390
Never!

12:06.320 --> 12:07.790
Not to you, feel-bad glasses!

12:08.340 --> 12:09.040
Dragon Pulse!

12:20.590 --> 12:22.100
Good job, Sonansu!

12:30.640 --> 12:31.540
Icy Wind!

12:48.690 --> 12:49.540
Stand by for capture...

12:51.430 --> 12:52.250
As if!

12:53.360 --> 12:55.200
Pumpjin, Dark Pulse!

12:56.710 --> 12:57.480
Metal Claw!

13:04.550 --> 13:06.180
Maaiika, Psybeam!

13:07.910 --> 13:08.560
Slash!

13:16.340 --> 13:17.650
Pumpjin, Leech Seed!

13:26.110 --> 13:27.690
I guess we have no choice.

13:27.690 --> 13:28.500
Metal Claw!

13:32.530 --> 13:33.450
You guys fight too!

13:40.270 --> 13:40.880
Pumpjin!

13:43.070 --> 13:44.280
Maaiika, return!

13:44.470 --> 13:44.970
Return!

13:45.320 --> 13:46.590
These guys are strong.

13:54.000 --> 13:54.810
Let's collect it.

13:55.280 --> 13:55.590
Roger!

14:16.070 --> 14:17.000
Th-This is...!

14:36.850 --> 14:37.440
What's the matter?

14:38.390 --> 14:39.750
It got big!

14:40.180 --> 14:41.470
What's with this guy...?

14:42.530 --> 14:43.670
Oh my...

14:43.670 --> 14:44.610
It's angry.

15:10.710 --> 15:12.360
That power... is the real deal.

15:13.620 --> 15:16.230
We're not going to let things go like they did at Terminus Cave!

15:17.150 --> 15:18.710
I can't believe how powerful it is.

15:18.710 --> 15:20.770
Geez, I don't get what's going on at all.

15:27.060 --> 15:27.510
Oh shoot!

15:27.810 --> 15:28.320
Here it comes!

15:33.350 --> 15:34.450
He made it in time!

15:38.200 --> 15:39.170
That Lizardon...!

15:40.110 --> 15:40.640
So that's the one?

15:41.920 --> 15:42.450
You...!

15:43.680 --> 15:44.830
I'll buy some time.

15:45.460 --> 15:45.970
Hurry!

15:50.270 --> 15:50.800
Lizardon!

15:51.360 --> 15:52.430
Dragon Claw!

15:52.870 --> 15:54.060
It <i>is</i> him!

16:01.190 --> 16:02.600
Respond to my heart,

16:03.040 --> 16:03.810
Key Stone!

16:04.790 --> 16:05.870
Surpass evolution!

16:06.630 --> 16:07.620
Mega evolve!

16:14.270 --> 16:15.120
Begin with the capture!

16:18.230 --> 16:19.710
We can't let them beat us to the punch!

16:20.120 --> 16:21.240
Let's thwart them!

16:21.560 --> 16:22.680
Rocket Gang, fight!

16:26.170 --> 16:26.530
Here it comes.

16:27.000 --> 16:27.590
Block it!

16:45.200 --> 16:45.960
Dragon Claw!

16:56.450 --> 16:57.150
This light...?

17:12.030 --> 17:14.180
This is indeed going to prove a bit tricky, isn't it?

17:25.510 --> 17:26.690
Maximum output!

17:49.870 --> 17:50.980
It's over.

17:50.980 --> 17:52.130
No!

17:52.510 --> 17:54.290
That thing belongs to the Rocket Gang!

17:54.530 --> 17:55.950
We won't hand it over, no matter what!

18:00.810 --> 18:03.140
This feels bad!

18:10.970 --> 18:12.610
We've managed to secure Z2.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.660
All right, this has been a huge success!

18:18.500 --> 18:19.800
Well done, Lizardon!

18:21.160 --> 18:22.290
Alan, isn't it?

18:22.990 --> 18:25.170
Thanks to you, we were able to complete our mission.

18:25.690 --> 18:26.490
But why?

18:26.920 --> 18:29.170
You're supposed to be under Fleur-de-lis-sama's direct supervision, right?

18:29.400 --> 18:30.800
I received orders from the director...

18:31.400 --> 18:33.110
...to assist you with the capture of Z2.

18:35.780 --> 18:37.930
I see. So you've encountered it.

18:38.260 --> 18:39.450
Yes. Also...

18:39.730 --> 18:45.040
We have confirmed that this new Pokémon species can fuse to become an incredibly powerful Pokémon.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.950
We were thinking its strength could be of use for the Rocket Gang.

18:49.240 --> 18:50.340
Continue investigating the matter.

18:50.760 --> 18:51.200
Roger!

18:53.560 --> 18:57.370
All right, we'll be busy now that the Lizardon Man has become involved as well!

18:57.560 --> 18:59.090
What happens twice will happen Gigaiathrice!

18:59.470 --> 19:01.320
Next time we meet them, we'll make them weep!

19:01.620 --> 19:03.670
Down with the feel-bad glasses guys!

19:09.640 --> 19:11.990
Answer! Answer!

19:17.520 --> 19:18.180
Squishy?

19:18.520 --> 19:20.110
Eureka, it's time to go.

19:21.130 --> 19:22.750
Squishy isn't feeling that well...

19:23.010 --> 19:25.680
Being exposed to the sun did not make it feel better?

19:26.180 --> 19:28.940
No... It looks like it's worried about something.

19:29.320 --> 19:30.100
I see...

19:31.010 --> 19:34.250
Eureka, maybe you should give it a hug.

19:35.210 --> 19:35.540
Yeah.

19:36.270 --> 19:37.470
So it feels safe...

19:38.400 --> 19:39.060
Squishy...

19:40.490 --> 19:41.400
It'll be fine.

19:42.360 --> 19:43.660
I'm here.

19:48.790 --> 19:51.510
The Flare Gang are carrying out one plan after another.

19:52.230 --> 19:57.810
The cogwheels of fate have at last started winding in what will lead to the destruction of the Kalos region.

20:09.210 --> 20:09.950
Zygarde...

20:10.610 --> 20:11.940
You're mine.

20:15.910 --> 20:20.900
Sunday February 14th at 8am!

20:16.820 --> 20:19.520
Pokénchi is visited by idols!

20:16.820 --> 20:19.520
LOVE REVOLUTION 21!

20:19.520 --> 20:20.500
Wo Fu-!

20:23.760 --> 20:25.760
Pokémon Unbelievable!

20:26.730 --> 20:31.470
This is Pokémon Unbelievable, which features the mysterious ecology of Pokémon!

20:32.000 --> 20:35.130
This unknown life form is also full of mysteries.

20:35.470 --> 20:39.540
It seems to restock nourishment not with food, but by bathing in the sun.

20:39.900 --> 20:43.420
It also fuses with things that appear to be small life forms,

20:43.720 --> 20:46.700
which causes it to change appearance and to power up.

20:47.040 --> 20:53.690
There is a theory that this unknown life form is the legendary Pokémon Zygarde, but the truth is still not clear.

20:56.280 --> 20:57.730
Heh heh heh...

20:57.730 --> 21:00.060
I have a present for you, Squishy!

21:00.060 --> 21:02.440
It is "Massage Squish-Squish-kun Mark I"!

21:02.690 --> 21:03.940
That feels nice, right?

21:03.940 --> 21:07.380
This perfectly replicates Eureka's squishing.

21:08.330 --> 21:08.860
Huh?

21:08.860 --> 21:09.900
Something is off...

21:12.540 --> 21:13.140
Cough...

21:18.110 --> 21:19.980
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.200 --> 21:21.290
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.280 --> 21:25.290
A dry wasteland and a scorching sun...

21:25.870 --> 21:27.460
It is over for me... Thud.

21:27.880 --> 21:29.540
Bro, there's something over there!

21:29.540 --> 21:31.320
Wham! That's a robot!

21:31.730 --> 21:34.110
What do you and your friends want from Robon?!

21:34.440 --> 21:35.060
"Robon"?

21:35.790 --> 21:38.740
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

21:39.210 --> 21:41.650
A Brigarron from the Wilderness! The Tree-planting Robon!!

21:42.010 --> 21:44.370
Everyone, Citronic Gear, On!

21:42.410 --> 21:45.870
Next Time

21:42.410 --> 21:45.870
A Brigarron from the Wilderness!
The Tree-planting Robon!!

21:45.870 --> 21:45.870
Next episode:

21:45.870 --> 21:45.870
A bond between a human, a Pokémon and a robot

21:46.700 --> 21:51.290
Pocket Monsters XY&Z was brought to you by these sponsors.

21:50.940 --> 21:55.910
Make flowers bloom in the wilderness!!
